OL,3,GNEWSAOil clean-up continues as beaches
OL,4,Aremain closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is continuing to clean up oil
OL,7,Fdeposits along the coastline which
OL,8,Fcaused the closure of 18 beaches in
OL,9,FKent.
OL,11,FThe pollution was discovered across
OL,12,Falmost the whole of the Thanet
OL,13,Fcoastline on 11 November, with several
OL,14,Fagencies working together as part of
OL,15,Fthe response.
OL,17,FThe beaches remained closed as of
OL,18,FMonday afternoon, with warning signs up
OL,19,Ffrom Minnis Bay in Birchington to
OL,20,FRamsgate Main Sands.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
