OL,3,GNEWSAOil clean-up continues as beaches
OL,4,Aremain closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Humber, Thanet District Council's
OL,7,Fdirector for the environment, told BBC
OL,8,FRadio Kent "really good progress" had
OL,9,Fbeen made by the contractor appointed
OL,10,Fby the authority.
